// const 0 >s dyn(-1) -> 1. Exercises the swapped dispatch: a const LHS routes
// SGT to the SLT helper (0 >s x  <=>  x <s 0; dyn(-1) <s 0 is true).
// SGT pops top as LHS, so make the dynamic RHS first, then PUSH 0 on top.
PUSH32 0xffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffff
PUSH1 0x00
MSTORE
PUSH1 0x00
MLOAD
PUSH1 0x00
SGT
PUSH1 0x00
MSTORE
PUSH1 0x20
PUSH1 0x00
RETURN
